rvival Horror gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Possibly the scariest and most disturbing game ever created</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Heart-rending Detective Noir Story, guaranteed to traumatize you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Eerie Original Soundtrack written and performed by the solo developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Perma-death (for the protagonist and possibly you, too)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Loosens your grip on reality and also your bowels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tutorials and menus intentionally deceive you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-May summon the recently deceased into your gaming room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/66c5f0db40ad8ff741b38d8083fe21a0.poster.avif?t=1779458416\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/66c5f0db40ad8ff741b38d8083fe21a0.webm?t=1779458416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/66c5f0db40ad8ff741b38d8083fe21a0.mp4?t=1779458416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/cc9342fabf79a9c632ef1d647fd5cdac.poster.avif?t=1779458416\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/cc9342fabf79a9c632ef1d647fd5cdac.webm?t=1779458416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153190/extras/cc9342fabf79a9c632ef1d647fd5cdac.mp4?t=1779458416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><